  "betreff": "Your business lunch at «roots» on 3 December",
  "text": "Dear Mr Taylor\n\nThank you very much for your request. We would be delighted to welcome you and your guests for our business lunch on Thursday, 3 December, at 12.30 pm.\n\nOur business lunch is served on Thursdays from 12.00 to 2.30 pm: three courses for CHF 98, four courses for CHF 110 or five courses for CHF 122. Vegetables are at the heart of every course. We have noted that one of your guests is vegetarian; our kitchen will take this into account.\n\nShould there be any allergies or intolerances, please let us know in advance.\n\nWe look forward to seeing you.\n\nKind regards\n\nThe «roots» team",
  "team": "Grundlage: Karte (Businesslunch donnerstags 12.00 bis 14.30 Uhr, 3/4/5 Gänge CHF 98/110/122), Über uns (Gemüse im Mittelpunkt)\nOffen: Tisch für vier am 3. Dezember mittags, vegetarischer Gast an die Küche",
  "vorlage": "reservation",
